theme_override_fonts/font = ExtResource("3_gdtss")
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 28
text = "How to Play:
Each round, you will receive 
three different voting choices.
Each choice represents a new bill or law that could change your town. 
Pick the option you think is best. 
Every choice has different benefits and drawbacks. 

Your decisions will affect three things: 
the number of people, 
the number of buildings, 
and your town's happiness meter.

You will have up to 15 rounds of voting. 
If your town's happiness gets too low, the game ends. 
If you survive all 15 rounds, you win! 
You will then see how your decisions changed the town.

REMEBER: YOUR VOTE MATTERS!!"

